<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾶμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράννυμι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mixture</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				95e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1109e
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ψυχῆς καὶ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.372
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>mixed wine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ca.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				383.148
			</span></i> (Nemrud Dagh, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.140f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.113
			</span></i> (misspelt <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραμμα</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.174
			</span></i>); also of medicines, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.211
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.265
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρέμμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aristipp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>alloy</i> of metals, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.56
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραμάσαι</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεμάννυμι</span>
			.</div>
